OL,3,GNEWSAFinal push for Look North sofa
OL,4,AChildren in Need challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy Garcia and Lindsey Burrow are
OL,7,Fnearing the end of their challenge to
OL,8,Fpush the BBC Look North red sofa across
OL,9,FYorkshire for Children in Need
OL,11,FThe 80-mile Push for Pudsey got under
OL,12,Fway in Ripon on Monday, and will finish
OL,13,Flater as they arrive at Wakefield
OL,14,FTrinity's Belle Vue ground
OL,16,FA town crier sent them on their way
OL,17,Fthis morning, with big crowds cheering
OL,18,Foutside Morley Town Hall
OL,20,FAs they began the challenge, Amy and
OL,21,FLindsey said they wanted to "do
OL,22,FYorkshire proud"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
